        "filing_date": "2026-02-13",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "As of February 10, 2026, we operate our DraftKings-branded iGaming product offering in New Jersey pursuant to a license granted by the New Jersey Division of Gaming Enforcement, in Connecticut pursuant to a license granted by the State of Connecticut Department of Consumer Protection, in Michigan pursuant to a license granted by the Michigan Gaming Control Board, in the Canadian Province of Ontario pursuant to a license granted by the Alcohol and Gaming Commission of Ontario, in Pennsylvania pursuant to a license granted by the Pennsylvania Gaming Control Board and in West Virginia pursuant to a license granted by the West Virginia Lottery.",
        "start_character": 34347,
        "end_character": 34995
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001883685-26-000013",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001883685-26-000013-c1cbf33d2df008df",
        "accession_number": "0001883685-26-000013",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-13",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "As of February 10, 2026, we operate our online sports betting product offering via the DraftKings Sportsbook app in Arizona, Colorado, Connecticut, Illinois, Indiana, Iowa, Kansas, Kentucky, Louisiana, Maine, Maryland, Massachusetts, Michigan, Missouri, New Hampshire, New Jersey, New York, North Carolina, Ohio, Oregon, Pennsylvania, Tennessee, Vermont, Virginia, Washington, D.C., West Virginia and Wyoming pursuant to our licenses,",
        "start_character": 30189,
        "end_character": 30623
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001883685-26-000013",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001883685-26-000013-c1cbf33d2df008df",
        "accession_number": "0001883685-26-000013",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-13",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition to our DraftKings-branded sports betting product offering, we operate our GNOG branded online sports betting product offering via the GNOG Sportsbook app in Arizona pursuant to our licenses granted by the state’s gaming or lottery commission as described above.",
        "start_character": 32009,
        "end_character": 32282
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001883685-26-000013",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001883685-26-000013-c1cbf33d2df008df",
        "accession_number": "0001883685-26-000013",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-13",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition to our two primary product offerings, we also offer DFS, digital lottery courier, prediction markets and other product offerings.",
        "start_character": 4831,
        "end_character": 4972
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001883685-26-000013",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001883685-26-000013-c1cbf33d2df008df",
        "accession_number": "0001883685-26-000013",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-13",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition, we operate our GNOG-branded iGaming product offering in Michigan, New Jersey, Pennsylvania, West Virginia, and Ontario, Canada subject to licenses issued by the Michigan Gaming Control Board, the New Jersey Division of Gaming Enforcement, Pennsylvania Gaming Control Board, the West Virginia Lottery and the Alcohol and Gaming Commission of Ontario, respectively.",
        "start_character": 34996,
        "end_character": 35372
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001883685-26-000013",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001883685-26-000013-c1cbf33d2df008df",
        "accession_number": "0001883685-26-000013",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-13",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In order to build the best product offerings, we have invested in core disciplines across our technology, analytics and marketing, which have allowed us to rapidly innovate and bring new experiences to market while gaining a unique understanding of our users.",
        "start_character": 9933,
        "end_character": 10192
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001883685-26-000013",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001883685-26-000013-c1cbf33d2df008df",
        "accession_number": "0001883685-26-000013",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-13",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Our business is subject to regulation under the laws, rules and regulations of the jurisdictions in which we operate.",
        "start_character": 22792,
        "end_character": 22909
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001883685-26-000013",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001883685-26-000013-c1cbf33d2df008df",
        "accession_number": "0001883685-26-000013",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-13",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Some of this intellectual property is in the form of software code, patented technology and trade secrets that we use to develop and properly run our Sportsbook, iGaming, DFS, digital lottery courier and prediction markets product offerings and related services.",
        "start_character": 16296,
        "end_character": 16558
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001883685-26-000013",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001883685-26-000013-c1cbf33d2df008df",
        "accession_number": "0001883685-26-000013",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-13",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "The gaming industry (inclusive of our Sportsbook and iGaming product offerings) is regulated, and we must maintain licenses and pay gaming taxes or a percentage of revenue where required by the jurisdictions in which we operate in order to continue our operations.",
        "start_character": 22527,
        "end_character": 22791
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001883685-26-000013",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001883685-26-000013-c1cbf33d2df008df",
        "accession_number": "0001883685-26-000013",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-13",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also make significant investments in sales and marketing and incentives to grow, retain, and monetize our paid user base, including personalized cross-product offers and promotions, and promote brand awareness to attract the “skin-in-the-game” sports fan.",
        "start_character": 1284,
        "end_character": 1542
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001883685-26-000013",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001883685-26-000013-c1cbf33d2df008df",
        "accession_number": "0001883685-26-000013",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-13",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We distribute our online sportsbook, iGaming, DFS, digital lottery courier and prediction markets product offerings through various channels, including traditional websites, direct app downloads and global direct-to-consumer digital platforms such as the Apple App Store and the Google Play Store.",
        "start_character": 15355,
        "end_character": 15652
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001883685-26-000013",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001883685-26-000013-c1cbf33d2df008df",
        "accession_number": "0001883685-26-000013",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-13",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We have developed and implemented an internal compliance program to help ensure that we comply with legal and regulatory requirements imposed on us in connection with our Sportsbook, iGaming, DFS and prediction markets product offerings.",
